\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li0\ri0\fi-144\sl-240\slmult0\tx720{\f0\fs24 \tab \b MICKEE\b0  Version 4.0 Release 6.D.4L is a mouse interface for WordStar 6.0 Revision D and above using Help-Level 4.  This release works exclusively with Logitech and compatible three- button mice (either older beige models or newer white models) and Logitech TrackMan trackballs.  MICKEE has been tested with Logitech Mouseware Versions 4.00, 4.10, and 5.00.  (Other versions of MICKEE are available:  see Appendix A at the end of this manual.)}\par
\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li0\ri0\fi-144\sl-240\slmult0\tx720{\f0\fs24 }\par
\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li0\ri0\fi-144\sl-240\slmult0\tx720{\f0\fs24 \tab Although fully protected by copyright, MICKEE can be freely used with any registered copy of WordStar.  Among MICKEE's features are:  }\par
\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li0\ri0\fi-144\sl-240\slmult0\tx720{\f0\fs24 }\par
\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li432\ri0\fi-432\sl-240\slmult0\tx432{\f0\fs24 \u9632?\tab \ul Context sensitivity\ulnone :  MICKEE always knows what you're doing.  It responds correctly whether you are at the Opening Menu, editing a file, using the thesaurus, in a dialog box, in a pulldown menu, or using Advanced Page Preview.  }\par
\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li432\ri0\fi-432\sl-240\slmult0\tx432{\f0\fs24 }\par
\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li432\ri0\fi-432\sl-240\slmult0\tx432{\f0\fs24 \u9632?\tab \ul Simple one-button operation\ulnone :  The left mouse button always brings down a pulldown menu if one isn't already active.  The left button also always selects an option from a pulldown menu.  (With WordStar International's WS.DEF, on the WordStar Advanced Customization diskette, you have to remember to press the middle button to pull down a menu and the left button to select\~-- very confusing!).  }\par
\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li432\ri0\fi-432\sl-240\slmult0\tx432{\f0\fs24 }\par
\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li432\ri0\fi-432\sl-240\slmult0\tx432{\f0\fs24 \u9632?\tab \ul Pointing and shooting\ulnone :  At all WordStar file, font, PIX, and other directories; at words in the thesaurus; at submenu names in the Notes and Paragraph-Style menus; at note types in the Convert-Notes dialog box; at subdirectory names; and at disk drive letters, page numbers, suggested spelling corrections, and window sizes.  }\par
\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li432\ri0\fi-432\sl-240\slmult0\tx432{\f0\fs24 }\par
\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li432\ri0\fi-432\sl-240\slmult0\tx432{\f0\fs24 \u9632?\tab \ul Fast block manipulation\ulnone :  Buttons mark the current sentence or paragraph; button combinations set beginning and ending block markers, move blocks with reformat at the source and destination, and hide or reveal marked blocks.  }\par
\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li432\ri0\fi-432\sl-240\slmult0\tx432{\f0\fs24 }\par
\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li432\ri0\fi-432\sl-240\slmult0\tx432{\f0\fs24 \u9632?\tab \ul Full support for Advanced Page Preview\ulnone :  Use APP's pulldown menus to select functions, or use the mouse buttons to magnify or reduce the image, jump back to a full-page view, or adjust the viewing window.  }\par
\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li432\ri0\fi-432\sl-240\slmult0\tx432{\f0\fs24 }\par
\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li432\ri0\fi-432\sl-240\slmult0\tx432{\f0\fs24 \u9632?\tab \ul Works with any number of screen rows\ulnone :  MICKEE works fine whether you install WordStar for the standard 25 lines, 43- line EGA mode, or 50-line VGA mode.  }\par
