\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li0\ri0\fi-144\sl-240\slmult0\tx720{\f0\fs24 but you can change this to whatever you wish by following the instructions in the WS.DEF file.  Note that the middle button also reveals your MICKEE release number.  To leave this pop-up without changing logged disks, click on the happy face at the far right.  }\par
