\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li0\ri0\fi-144\sl-240\slmult0\tx720{\f0\fs24 \tab I believe most editing functions can be performed more efficiently by using the keyboard rather than a mouse.  However, block manipulations are a possible exception.  MICKEE's functionality while editing is therefore biased towards marking and moving blocks of text, but you can, of course, use your mouse under MICKEE to select any WordStar operation listed on the pulldown menus.  }\par
