\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li0\ri0\fi-144\sl-240\slmult0\tx720{\f0\fs24 }\par
\pard\plain\kerning1\ql\li0\ri0\fi-144\sl-240\slmult0\tx720{\f0\fs24 In the \b Convert-Notes\b0  dialog box, you are shown a list of the note types to which you can convert.  }\par
